  "releaseNotes": "* Added ``DirectoryInfo`` ``SafelyEnumerateFiles`` C# 14 extension everything method with several overloads to help avoid ``UnauthorizedAccessException`` being thrown when enumerating files in case access isn't permitted - This works on all TFMs although .NET 8+ TFMs have what is likely to be a more efficient implementation than the .NET Standard 2 implementation. \n* Added the ``FileInfo[]`` returning equivalent method and overloads to ``SafelyEnumerateFiles`` called ``SafelyGetFiles``.",
